Now let's create a summary table of the average air temperature for each basin


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
data_air <- data |>
  select(year, lake, air_temp_c) |>
  group_by(year, lake) |>
    summarise(average_air_temp = mean(air_temp_c),
              groups = "drop_last")

data_air
```

